      "title": "Dollar Retreats and Gold Rallies on Fed Rate Hike Doubts",
      "title_zh": "美联储加息疑虑导致美元回落和黄金上涨",
      "summary": "The dollar index (DXY00 ) dropped to a 7-week low on Friday and finished down -0.41%.. The dollar tumbled on Friday after the US July payroll report showed an unexpected decline in nonfarm payrolls and a smaller-than-expected increase in average hourly earnings, dovish factors for Fed policy.. Also, Friday’s rally...",
      "summary_zh": "美元指数(DXY00)周五跌至7周低点，收跌-0.41%。美国7月非农就业报告显示非农就业意外下降，平均时薪增幅低于预期，美联储政策鸽派因素，美元周五暴跌。此外，周五的反弹...",
      "analysis": "美联储收紧货币政策，加息预期升温，可能压制高估值成长股；银行股或受益于息差扩大",
      "category": "fed_policy",
